<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZCC clears NZ Co-operative Dairy Co's merger plan.</title>
<headline>NZCC clears NZ Co-operative Dairy Co's merger plan.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's anti-monopolies Commerce Commission on Monday cleared New Zealand Co-operative Dairy Company Ltd to acquire the assets of the East Tamaki Co-operative Dairy Company Ltd.</p>
<p>The Commission said it was satisfied that if the proposal went ahead, then NZCDC would not acquire or stengthen a dominant position in any market.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
